category: Science
requires: libsimgrid4.1 pkg-config
sdesc: "Framework for the simulation of distributed applications (development)"
ldesc: "SimGrid is a scientific instrument to study the behavior of large-scale
distributed systems such as Grids, Clouds, HPC or P2P systems. It can be used
to evaluate heuristics, prototype applications or even assess legacy MPI
applications."
external-source: simgrid

